:"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"毕竟是流荧树的兄弟之树，有弥萨忒的伟力，应该不会有什么...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1041567103:1":{"key":"say:4:1041567103:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041567103","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"话是这么说，但毕竟萨洛克兰是地底，那还是一棵地面上的树。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1041567104:1":{"key":"say:5:1041567104:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041567104","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"原本的园丁们都束手无策，毕竟他们也没照顾过这种植物。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1041567105:1":{"key":"say:6:1041567105:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041567105","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"降水姑且还能用人力弥补，但是光照和通风就没法保证了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1041567106:1":{"key":"say:7:1041567106:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1041567106","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不用担心，因度厄，作为弥萨忒的恩赐，它一定会像流荧树一